# A creature put onto the battlefield attacking a planeswalker that is no longer on the battlefield enters, but is never an
# attacking creature (CR 508.4a, 506.3c), and a sneaked one still enters tapped (CR 702.190b). Bot1 attacks Bot2's Liliana of
# the Veil (loyalty 3) with Ornithopter and, in the declare blockers step, casts Leonardo for his sneak cost {W}, returning
# the Ornithopter. With Leonardo on the stack Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at Liliana, which resolves first: she dies with no
# loyalty (CR 704.5i). Leonardo resolves tapped and not attacking, so he deals no combat damage: nobody gains or loses life,
# and he gets no counter.

